      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BONE SHAKER (1) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten one length (22.79) behind Sweet Begonia at this track. Ready to find winning form. CHEEKY MEEKI (2) is an accomplished sprinter with a great record at the short dashes. Kept coming to finish fourth over 390m at this track (22.51) latest in a Grade 5. Strike rate this distance strong having won five of nine tries. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Great chance to atone. PAW XYLA (8) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing second (23.55) at Horsham in a Grade 5 over 410m. Expecting another good run. PAW REX (5) boasts a solid strike-rate from this box.",
